    {
      "source": "Load bean definitions into the supplied <a href=\"../../../context/support/GenericApplicationContext.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.context.support\"><code>context</code></a>\nfrom the locations in the supplied <code>MergedContextConfiguration</code> using a\n<a href=\"../../../beans/factory/groovy/GroovyBeanDefinitionReader.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.beans.factory.groovy\"><code>GroovyBeanDefinitionReader</code></a>.",
